Download outputs and artifacts of a training job.

Without flags, downloads the job's default artifacts (logs and run files).
With --output-name, downloads a single named output.
With --all, downloads every named output plus the default artifacts.

Usage
  azd ai training job download [flags]

Flags
      --all                  : Download all named outputs and default artifacts
  -p, --download-path string : Path to download files to (used as-is when provided; defaults to ./<job-name>/ in the current directory)
  -n, --name string          : Job name (required)
      --output-name string   : Name of the user-defined output to download. If omitted (or set to "default"), the default artifacts are downloaded

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string              : Sets the current working directory
      --debug                   : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string      : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help                    : help for download
      --no-prompt               : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string           : The output format (default "default")
      --project-endpoint string : Azure AI Foundry project endpoint URL (e.g., https://account.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/project-name)
  -s, --subscription string     : Azure subscription ID (enables implicit init if environment not configured)

Examples
  Download logs and run files
    azd ai training job download --name my-job

  Download all named outputs and artifacts to a directory
    azd ai training job download --name my-job --all --download-path "./job outputs"
